---
name: Abandoned checkout
section: Orders
subject: Still thinking it over?
stores: global
---
{%- comment -%}
  Global store only. India runs its own checkout (/checkout), which never creates a Shopify
  checkout, so this email can't fire there; India cart recovery is the WhatsApp cart_reminder.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture email_title -%}Still thinking it over?{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture email_preheader -%}
  {%- if item_count == 1 -%}Your bag is still in your cart.{%- else -%}Your pieces are still in your cart.{%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mk_eyebrow = '' -%}
<!-- body -->
<p style="%%p%%">
  {%- if billing_address.first_name != blank %}Hi {{ billing_address.first_name }}, y{% else %}Y{% endif -%}
  ou left {% if item_count == 1 %}something{% else %}a few things{% endif %} in your cart. {% if item_count == 1 %}It's{% else %}They're{% endif %} still there whenever you're ready, while stock lasts.
</p>
{%- if custom_message != blank %}
<p style="%%p%%">{{ custom_message }}</p>
{%- endif %}

{%- assign mk_button_url = url -%}
{%- assign mk_button_label = 'Return to your cart' -%}
{% render 'button' %}

{%- assign mk_section = 'In your cart' -%}
{% render 'section-start' %}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
{%- for line in subtotal_line_items %}
  {%- if line.product.title != blank %}{% assign mk_item_title = line.product.title %}{% else %}{% assign mk_item_title = line.title %}{% endif -%}
  {%- if line.image %}{% capture mk_item_image %}{{ line | img_url: '240x', format: 'jpg' }}{% endcapture %}{% else %}{% assign mk_item_image = '' %}{% endif -%}
  {%- capture mk_item_meta -%}
    {%- if line.variant.title != 'Default Title' and line.variant.title != blank %}{{ line.variant.title }}&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;{% endif -%}
    Qty {{ line.quantity }}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign mk_item_note = '' -%}
  {%- assign mk_item_price = '' -%}
  {% render 'item-row' %}
{%- endfor %}
</table>
{% render 'section-end' %}
